# Copy to .env (`bun run setup` does this). Bun loads .env when a root
# script runs, and `bun run up` passes it to every service.
#
# List each variable the code reads. Put a `# Needed for: <feature>` line
# directly above it, so `bun run doctor` can say what breaks without it.
# Do not set PORT: `bun run up` gives each copy of the stack its own ports.
#
# Needed for: <feature>
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
